# HAVEN API base URL (optional).
#
# If unset:
#   - dev server (npm run dev)      -> "/" (Vite proxy -> local FastAPI :8000)
#   - production build (vite build) -> live AWS API Gateway
#
# Copy to `.env` and set this to force a specific endpoint, e.g.:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://6qc8x2kc9i.execute-api.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/dev
#
# VITE_API_URL=